MIT License, Copyright (c) 2017-present Sergii Stotskyi). Some files are translations of CASL source
code and some tests are ported from CASL's specs; they are listed, with CASL's licence, in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. The casl-net package depends on @casl/ability and @ucast/mongo2js at runtime.

